#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:2
msgid "snap-refresh-control interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `snap-refresh-control` interface allows extended control, via {ref}"
"`snapctl <how-to-guides-manage-snaps-use-snapctl>`, of refreshes targeting "
"the snap."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"**This interface and the full set of features it requires to function are "
"currently under development.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:9
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:11
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:11
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:14
msgid ""
"`snap-refresh-control` is a marker interface  (with no associated AppArmor "
"or Seccomp rules)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"Currently it allows connected snaps to execute `snapctl refresh --proceed` "
"to unblock pending refreshes outside of the context of the `gate-auto-"
"refresh` hook. This interface should be used with caution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:18
msgid "Code examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:20
msgid ""
"The test code can be found in the snapd repository: https://github.com/"
"canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/snap_refresh_control_test.go"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/snap-refresh-control-interface.md:22
msgid ""
"The source code for the interface is in the snapd repository: https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/"
"snap_refresh_control.go"
msgstr ""
